          <h3 class="review-card-title" data-i18n="pdp_facial_rev2_title">Gentle aloe mist</h3>
          <p class="review-card-body" data-i18n="pdp_facial_rev2_body">Shake, spray, done. Vitamin E and aloe feel light on the face after a thorough cleanse.</p>
          <div class="review-card-product">
            {% if product.featured_image %}
